+/*
+ * 0134: vendor arm_smmu_device_reset() order.  0133 left CB4 enabled
+ * (SCTLR.M=1) and then halted the micro-MMU, which deadlocked the NoC.
+ * Disable every context bank, clear its FSR, invalidate both TLBs and
+ * program sCR0 before any bank is touched again.
